            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"mini-project-1\">Mini Project 1</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Your choice of option, what each one asks for, the due date and how it is graded are on the Mini Project 1 page of the course site, linked from the calendar. This notebook is the shape to build it in. Keep the headings, and replace each line in italics with your own.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Save it in your course repository as <code>projects/mp1/&lt;your-tool&gt;.py</code>, named for what it does, such as <code>loan-schedule.py</code>, and open it with <code>uv run marimo edit</code>.</span></span>"
